Lightamer built-in film LUT set
===============================

The 40 .cube tables in this folder were generated with Spectral Film LUT
by Jan Lohse — https://github.com/JanLohse/spectral_film_lut — version
0.18.2 (commit 42f4f3fadfab3b7fcbdf8f9431c9b9d9aa05ce5f), at the tool's
export defaults with two documented deviations: LUT size 65 (the tool's
default is 33) and black-and-white stocks paired with the Kodak 2302
print stock.

The generator is MIT-licensed; its license text ships alongside as the
LICENSE file (Copyright (c) 2026 Jan Lohse). These tables are original
upstream-tool output — no bytes were copied from Alcedo Studio or any
other GPL codebase.
